{"t":"Putrefactory","s":"putrefactory-18433","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Sopping_Carcass_b02d5f.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Putrefactory</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Sopping Carcass\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sopping_Carcass_b02d5f.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northern Darama</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">One of the four hunting areas accessed through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Vestibule\">Blood Vestibule</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"34100,31688,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (34100, 31688, 14)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">13.20.13560<br/>July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIt is one of the areas of the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>. The creatures here deal 3 different elemental damages: Death, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice</a> and Energy (and Earth Damage for characters under the influence of at least three <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore%27s%20Taints\">Bakragore's Taints</a>), while being sensitive to Holy, Earth, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire</a>.\n</p><p>Indestructible <a href=\"#/wiki/Radicular%20Totem\">Radicular Totems</a> are scattered in this hunting ground. They unleash large Earth Damage wave spells hitting clockwise in cardinal directions (east, south, west, then north). If a creature dies near a Radicular Totem, its power counter  is raised (represented by a <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Quest Condition Red Blood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quest_Condition_Red_Blood_ccb372.png\" width=\"11\"/></span> icon next to its name) and the damage that is dealt by the next totem's wave increases.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Oozing%20Carcass\"><img alt=\"Oozing Carcass\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Oozing_Carcass_480fc1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Oozing%20Carcass\">Oozing Carcass</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">20,980</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">27,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lichen%20Gobbler\">Lichen Gobbler</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20Staff\">Skull Staff</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bone Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Gem\">Yellow Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Rotten Roots (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Decayed Finger Bone (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Bloody Edge (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook%20of%20Warding\">Spellbook of Warding</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sopping%20Carcass\"><img alt=\"Sopping Carcass\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sopping_Carcass_b02d5f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sopping%20Carcass\">Sopping Carcass</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">23,425</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">32,700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=